## Quick Reference

### iPhone Settings
- Resolution: 4K @ 60fps
- Stabilization: OFF
- Focus/Exposure: LOCKED

### Camera Positions (4 cameras ideal)
- 2 side cameras at 45° angle to kicker (4-6m away)
- 2 back cameras behind kicker
- Height: 1.2-1.5m (hip level)

### Zone Grid (3x3 = 9 zones)
```
┌────┬────┬────┐
│ 7  │ 8  │ 9  │ HIGH
├────┼────┼────┤
│ 4  │ 5  │ 6  │ MID
├────┼────┼────┤
│ 1  │ 2  │ 3  │ LOW
└────┴────┴────┘
LEFT  CENTER RIGHT
```

### Minimum Dataset
- Pilot: 50 kicks
- Training: 180 kicks (20/zone)
- Final: 270+ kicks (30/zone)

### Sync Method
1. Start all cameras
2. CLAP loudly in view of all cameras
3. Wait 2 seconds
4. Kick
5. Stop cameras
